LICENSE NOTICE — test-benchmarks/claims/simplewiki-sentences.txt
==================================================================

The 520 sentences in simplewiki-sentences.txt are unedited extracts from
71 Simple English Wikipedia articles, drawn from this repository's own
committed reference pack (corpus/reference/, REFERENCE_PACK_NAME =
"simplewiki" in src/domain/reference-pack.mjs). They are licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License
(CC BY-SA 4.0), NOT under this repository's MPL-2.0.

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.en

Attribution
-----------

This text is from Simple English Wikipedia, written by Wikipedia contributors
and available under CC BY-SA 4.0. A Wikipedia article has no single author:
the authoritative author list is its revision history, and per Wikipedia's own
reuse guidance linking to the article satisfies attribution. Every article used
here is listed below with its source URL and the exact revision id its text
was cut from (inherited from corpus/reference/manifest.json, the pinned
simplewiki dump both this pack and claim:prose-band's sentences trace back to).

Source and reproduction
------------------------

Sentences are extracted verbatim (no wording changes) from the article `text`
field already shipped in corpus/reference/shards/, itself built by
scripts/fetch-reference-pack.mjs from the pinned pages-articles dump recorded
in corpus/reference/manifest.json.

Share-alike — read this before reusing
---------------------------------------

CC BY-SA 4.0's share-alike condition is viral. If you redistribute this file,
modified or not, you must do so under CC BY-SA 4.0 with this attribution.

